ViewBS Rust Installation

The Rust rewrite is distributed primarily as release archives. Download the archive for your operating system from:

https://github.com/xie186/ViewBS/releases/latest

Unpack the archive and put the `ViewBS` executable on your `PATH`.

To build from source:

```
cargo install --locked --path .
```

For package maintainers:

- Bioconda packaging is defined in `conda/meta.yaml`.
- Docker packaging is defined in `ViewBSdocker/Dockerfile`.
- Release-candidate validation is documented in `docs/release.md`.

The standalone Rust binary does not require external scripting, plotting, or indexed-file runtimes to run ViewBS commands.
